  "remarksWeb": "1. PAN is not allotted to proprietorship concerns i.e Espee Drugs & Finechem Co., so dummy PAN is provided.  2. Senores Biologics Private Limited (SBPL) has been incorporated on July 31, 2025, wherein one of the promoters of the Company Mr. Swapnil Jatinbhai Shah holds 50% of the equity share capital. Hence, SBPL falls under the category of Promoter Group, since its incorporation. Further, SBPL does not hold any shares in the Company, since its incorporation.  3. Renosen Ventures Inc., was incorporated on February 18, 2025, which is a wholly owned subsidiary company of Renosen Pharmaceuticals Private Limited (RPPL). One of the prmoters of the Company, Mr. Swapnil Jatinbhai Shah holds 50% of the equity share capital of RPPL. Accordingly, Renosen Ventures Inc. falls under the category of Promoter Group, since its incorporation. Indvertantly the same was not mentioned in the shareholding pattern submitted earlier.The same has been included now in this report. Further, Renosen Ventures Inc. does not hold any shares in the Company, since its incorporation.",
